OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers aim to sew town's
OL,4,A1,200-year history
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtist Harriet Mee said trying to fit
OL,7,Fhundreds of years of history into the
OL,8,Fdesigns was "quite a tall order", but
OL,9,Fshe was honoured to be trusted with the
OL,10,Fjob.
